WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.780
In 1985, a famous cola
maker changed its recipe.

2
00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:07.640
Before the switch, it ran taste tests.

3
00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.480
The sweeter new flavour
beat the old recipe,

4
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.470
and a rival cola too.

5
00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:15.030
Many loyal buyers protested.

6
00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:18.530
79 days later, the original was back.

7
00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:21.060
So how can a company
ask thousands of people

8
00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:24.300
what they want and still
get the answer wrong?

9
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.000
In this mission, you'll compare
primary and secondary research,

10
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.280
and see how a sample is chosen.

11
00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.800
Then you'll map a market,

12
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.860
brand by brand, and look for a
gap that might be worth filling.

13
00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:40.830
Your mission: find out why a
well-researched idea can still fail.
